          "start_line": 76,
          "end_line": 135,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "These branches invoke streaming compression and finish the frame."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "trigger",
      "statement": "The parameter helper draws a strategy between ZSTD_STRATEGY_MIN and ZSTD_STRATEGY_MAX, adjusts the parameters, and sets the resulting strategy on the compression context.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-6b301a2f40efcfbb4780",
          "start_line": 44,
          "end_line": 57,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-d12ebcf33fdbb6d713f7",
          "start_line": 101,
          "end_line": 110,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "FUZZ_setRandomParameters passes the adjusted strategy to ZSTD_CCtx_setParameter."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "After the change, ZSTD_adjustCParams_internal conditionally cascades an excluded strategy to a lower strategy; excluding doubleFast cascades it to fast and resets targetLength to zero.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-cacfbc01dbc54c190571",
          "start_line": 1,
          "end_line": 41,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "target_route",
      "statement": "Streaming initialization derives compression parameters from the context's requested parameters. ZSTD_getCParamsFromCCtxParams calls ZSTD_adjustCParams_internal, so this is an additional adjustment route before compression.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91",
          "start_line": 6175,
          "end_line": 6208,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91",
          "start_line": 1624,
          "end_line": 1637,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "This function applies ZSTD_adjustCParams_internal to the derived parameters."
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91",
          "start_line": 6285,
          "end_line": 6307,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "ZSTD_compressStream2 invokes transparent streaming initialization."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "After the change, the block selector uses ZSTD_COMPRESSBLOCK macros for its strategy entries, chooses a row based table when applicable, and asserts that the selected compressor is nonnull.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91",
          "start_line": 3029,
          "end_line": 3115,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "The changed selection code has a row based dispatch route. The supplied lines do not define the ZSTD_COMPRESSBLOCK macros, so their callable values under exclusion flags remain unresolved.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91",
          "start_line": 3082,
          "end_line": 3114,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "alternative",
      "statement": "The ordinary software matchfinder and the sequence producer's enabled fallback both invoke ZSTD_selectBlockCompressor. A successful sequence producer result returns before those calls, providing a distinct route for that block.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91",
          "start_line": 3286,
          "end_line": 3355,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-194debf8ea4cd55b47ba",
          "start_line": 156,
          "end_line": 164,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "The harness helper either configures a sequence producer or unregisters it."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "configuration",
      "statement": "The supplied build script delegates fuzz target compilation to fuzz.py. The displayed new libzstd.mk assignments default two exclusion variables to zero when they are not overridden; these lines do not establish the effective settings for this target.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-043cf5aa9ced10a35cb6",
          "start_line": 19,
          "end_line": 24,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-fe22d2cdbb2a3c4846ec",
          "start_line": 1,
          "end_line": 2,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "These are conditional defaults in the library makefile; whether the delegated fuzz build uses or overrides them is not shown."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "consequence",
      "statement": "The existing harness checks every streaming compression return for a zstd error, then checks successful decompression, regenerated size, and byte equality with the input.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085",
          "start_line": 81,
          "end_line": 135,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085",
          "start_line": 185,
          "end_line": 205,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "These are the existing decompression and round trip checks."
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-a7cd9e43defd8d40468a",
          "start_line": 40,
          "end_line": 47,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "FUZZ_ZASSERT aborts when a zstd call reports an error."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "missing_information": [
    "The effective stream_round_trip compiler definitions after fuzz.py delegates to its build recipe, including whether compressor exclusion variables or macros are enabled.",
    "The definitions of the ZSTD_COMPRESSBLOCK dispatch macros under the effective compiler definitions."
  ],
  "requested_symbols": [
    "ZSTD_COMPRESSBLOCK_DOUBLEFAST",
    "ZSTD_COMPRESSBLOCK_GREEDY",
